  m_text: "\n\n\nIf you found a way to get out of the room, you will probably find
    this letter.\r\n\r\nListen, there are still some things you need to do to escape
    this cursed place. \r\nI\u2019m sure there is something you can use to cut the
    wooden planks on the main door\u2014they cannot be removed by hand.\r\n\r\nAlso,
    there is a keypad that requires a sequence of numbers in the correct order for
    the main door to finally open.\r\n\r\nIf I remember correctly, the sequence is:\r\n\r\nCircle
    -> Triangle -> Square -> ?\r\n\r\nThink beyond what you see. Think of what completes
    them.\n\nSome things in this place are not decoration.\nFaith is not decoration
    either.\n\nThe dead still wait for what was denied to them.\nGive the sinner
    what he begs for, and he may offer you something in return.\n\nDo not trust the
    silence.\nDo not trust your memories.\n\nAnd whatever you do\u2026\nDo not look
    into the mirror for too long.\n\n\u2014 A Stranger"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f8ed56f3e123473468b9a5365e70f7c0, type: 2}
